  "notes": "Operating temperature footnote: module turns up from cold start at ambient as low as -5C and reaches specifications after self-heating to min operating temperature (+15C). Increasing CDC search range to 2x default increases power consumption by 0.6W. Encryption adds 0.6W@400G, 0.5W@300G, 0.4W@200G, 0.3W@100G. Tx power can be provisioned up to maximum available; default is maximum within a 10dB attenuation range from max. Application table Tx Power 1dBm is minimum without attenuation. Rx_LOS assert -28.0dBm set for 400G modes; configurable per module for other modes. Absolute max: Rx signal input power +13dBm; Rx total input power +15dBm. Rx sens values measured at OSNR >36dB. Nominal wavelengths stated as 191.3-196.1 THz tunable with 100GHz spacing. AES-256 encryption capable. Power consumption values are EOL @ Default CD Range w/o Encryption.",
